Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,All-Out Basketball
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,00:00:17.92,00:00:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode, in the game between Team Defenders and Team Lion Heart,
Dialogue: 0,00:00:22.16,00:00:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,facing the massively popular Team Lion Heart for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,00:00:25.24,00:00:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the little goats were rattled by the opposing team’s fans and played hesitantly.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:29.92,00:00:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, Sparky broke the deadlock thanks to his recent training.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:39.56,00:00:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we knew it, the first half was over.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:42.20,00:00:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders managed to tie it up at 30–30.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:45.68,00:00:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This game is getting more and more intense.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:50.32,00:00:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, little goats!
Dialogue: 0,00:00:52.60,00:00:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, Lion Jay, cool guy of the Milky Way!
Dialogue: 0,00:00:54.92,00:00:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, Lion Jay, my number one every day!
Dialogue: 0,00:00:57.36,00:00:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s keep playing just like this.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:59.68,00:01:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:02.96,00:01:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The second half is underway.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:07.84,00:01:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t let the goats score again.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:10.20,00:01:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, it’s time to run our practiced defensive scheme.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:19.44,00:01:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of defense is this? Even I’ve never seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:24.12,00:01:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t take it.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:26.60,00:01:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s really powerful.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:37.52,00:01:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not gonna be that easy.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:40.44,00:01:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me get past you.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:42.36,00:01:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands in pockets! Looks cooler that way!
Dialogue: 0,00:01:44.96,00:01:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay cool! Cool!
Dialogue: 0,00:01:50.52,00:01:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:56.76,00:01:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your brand image! Keep your hands in pockets!
Dialogue: 0,00:01:59.44,00:02:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you say you’d take every game seriously?
Dialogue: 0,00:02:17.36,00:02:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders is on a furious run.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:19.96,00:02:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The lead has grown considerably in no time.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:24.04,00:02:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, Lion Jay, cool guy of the Milky Way!
Dialogue: 0,00:02:26.40,00:02:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, Lion Jay, my number one every day!
Dialogue: 0,00:02:29.48,00:02:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That cool pose! Gotta look cool! Cool!
Dialogue: 0,00:02:35.48,00:02:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay?
Dialogue: 0,00:02:37.12,00:02:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Team Lion Heart really going to just hand them the win?
Dialogue: 0,00:02:45.52,00:02:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I even doing?
Dialogue: 0,00:02:55.00,00:02:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out you’re all hype and no skill.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:58.00,00:03:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t deserve to be on the court at all.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:03.72,00:03:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, we’re huge fans.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:05.52,00:03:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we get your autograph and take a picture with you?
Dialogue: 0,00:03:08.68,00:03:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry…
Dialogue: 0,00:03:09.52,00:03:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I just lost, so I’m feeling a bit…
Dialogue: 0,00:03:11.04,00:03:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you lost, we still love you.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:13.28,00:03:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you’re so handsome.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:15.48,00:03:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, look at the camera.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:19.28,00:03:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I got an autographed photo with Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,00:03:21.72,00:03:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Even though you lost the game,
Dialogue: 0,00:03:22.96,00:03:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,your fans still adore you.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:24.80,00:03:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wanted to win.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:26.08,00:03:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t win every game.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:28.00,00:03:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can assure you,
Dialogue: 0,00:03:29.44,00:03:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,you’re definitely winning when it comes to popularity.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:32.68,00:03:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I…
Dialogue: 0,00:03:33.84,00:03:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s fine, as long as you have a good image.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:36.52,00:03:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, strike another cool pose.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:49.24,00:03:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really the kind of basketball I wanted to play?
Dialogue: 0,00:04:02.80,00:04:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch!
Dialogue: 0,00:04:18.96,00:04:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands in pockets!
Dialogue: 0,00:04:25.76,00:04:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The lead has grown to 28 points.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:28.16,00:04:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it’s all but over.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:37.96,00:04:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you plan to keep coasting like this?
Dialogue: 0,00:04:40.68,00:04:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren’t you the one who told me to enjoy the game?
Dialogue: 0,00:04:50.20,00:04:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s great, Blazey.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:51.60,00:04:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is that 99% win rate you were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:03.84,00:05:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch the camera. Watch your image.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:07.40,00:05:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us a cool shot.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:23.56,00:05:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A cool shot.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:25.24,00:05:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,00:05:26.88,00:05:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:29.36,00:05:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,With a look like that…I really want to play a real game against him.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:48.92,00:05:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,00:05:50.36,00:05:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,00:05:55.68,00:05:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They both went down!
Dialogue: 0,00:06:02.36,00:06:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That was an incredible play.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:10.84,00:06:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the game, focus on the game—
Dialogue: 0,00:06:14.16,00:06:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the strongest version of you.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:18.68,00:06:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 0,00:06:21.24,00:06:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Timeout!
Dialogue: 0,00:06:22.72,00:06:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:23.96,00:06:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:25.68,00:06:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we need the medical staff?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:28.08,00:06:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Lion Heart has called a timeout.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:31.44,00:06:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, put this on.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:33.88,00:06:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:35.00,00:06:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a bandage from our sponsor.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:37.48,00:06:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a rare product placement opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:40.08,00:06:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain has a bruise from the impact; a bandage won’t help with that, will it?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:43.84,00:06:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares if it actually helps?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:45.28,00:06:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remember to flaunt it for the camera.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:48.52,00:06:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really the kind of basketball I want to play?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:51.00,00:06:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the game, focus on the game—
Dialogue: 0,00:06:53.52,00:06:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the strongest version of you.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:56.20,00:06:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just let me play a real game.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:56.20,00:06:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}Don’t worry, Lion Jay is fine—
Dialogue: 0,00:07:02.16,00:07:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you playing a game right now?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:05.88,00:07:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a game where I can go all out,
Dialogue: 0,00:07:08.20,00:07:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,not some meaningless exhibition show.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:09.76,00:07:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re already trailing by a lot.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:13.48,00:07:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s fine; your fans won’t blame you for losing.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:17.56,00:07:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:18.20,00:07:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, Lion Jay, cool guy of the Milky Way!
Dialogue: 0,00:07:20.56,00:07:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They love you too much to care!
Dialogue: 0,00:07:20.56,00:07:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}Lion Jay, Lion Jay, my number one every day!
Dialogue: 0,00:07:22.80,00:07:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you change your style,
Dialogue: 0,00:07:24.48,00:07:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you’ll lose all your fans,
Dialogue: 0,00:07:26.20,00:07:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and you won’t be a basketball star anymore.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:33.84,00:07:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to live a lie anymore.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:35.88,00:07:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to play this game as a real player,
Dialogue: 0,00:07:39.20,00:07:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,not as an idol.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:41.20,00:07:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What! You…you dare defy me?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:43.80,00:07:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who kept you on this team?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:45.80,00:07:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who built you up into a basketball star?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:48.28,00:07:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,00:07:48.88,00:07:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Manager.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:49.52,00:07:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let Lion Jay play a real game for once.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:52.48,00:07:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to play hard alongside Lion Jay, too.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:55.56,00:07:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:57.36,00:07:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys…
Dialogue: 0,00:08:01.32,00:08:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone’s playing great.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:02.68,00:08:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve got this in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:09.08,00:08:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:11.88,00:08:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything you’ve done for me, but I’m truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:16.36,00:08:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to try forging my own path.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:19.06,00:08:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:21.04,00:08:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you dare take another step,
Dialogue: 0,00:08:22.60,00:08:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you won’t be a member of Team Lion Heart anymore!
Dialogue: 0,00:08:30.88,00:08:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You…you’d better think this through carefully!
Dialogue: 0,00:08:38.68,00:08:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the momentum up, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,00:08:40.52,00:08:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,00:08:55.56,00:08:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice move!
Dialogue: 0,00:08:56.48,00:08:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie breaks through Team Lion Heart’s defense.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:58.60,00:09:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Team Defenders is about to score again.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:01.12,00:09:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish it, Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,00:09:03.04,00:09:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You’d better think this through carefully!
Dialogue: 0,00:09:05.88,00:09:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay…
Dialogue: 0,00:09:07.44,00:09:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, look at the camera.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:09.20,00:09:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, you look so cool.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:12.64,00:09:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the kind of basketball you wanted to play?
Dialogue: 0,00:09:15.08,00:09:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re going to lose if you keep this up.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:16.80,00:09:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But it doesn’t matter; no one will blame you.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:19.96,00:09:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn’t what I wanted…
Dialogue: 0,00:09:21.72,00:09:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,People love the way you play.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:23.56,00:09:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You just need to show your coolest side on the biggest stage.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:27.76,00:09:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:50.88,00:09:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ball!
Dialogue: 0,00:09:53.12,00:09:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,00:09:54.56,00:09:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back on D!
Dialogue: 0,00:10:14.32,00:10:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,00:10:17.12,00:10:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m on it!
Dialogue: 0,00:10:27.12,00:10:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just…watch closely!
Dialogue: 0,00:10:31.16,00:10:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,00:10:32.60,00:10:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the real… me!
Dialogue: 0,00:11:07.28,00:11:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is…is that Lion Jay?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:09.60,00:11:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:11.12,00:11:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Lion Jay?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:12.40,00:11:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s way too aggressive!
Dialogue: 0,00:11:15.68,00:11:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:17.08,00:11:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s over; all my marketing is ruined!
Dialogue: 0,00:11:24.76,00:11:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This can’t be real…
Dialogue: 0,00:11:26.16,00:11:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,—Calm down. —My Lion Jay has totally changed.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:28.36,00:11:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t tell me Team Lion Heart is also…
Dialogue: 0,00:11:30.84,00:11:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s get another bucket!
Dialogue: 0,00:11:38.72,00:11:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Lion Heart, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,00:11:40.20,00:11:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,From this moment on,
Dialogue: 0,00:11:41.76,00:11:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,we’re going to chip away at this lead, one bucket at a time.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:45.72,00:11:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We have only one goal!
Dialogue: 0,00:11:50.52,00:11:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To go all out and win this game!
Dialogue: 0,00:11:55.24,00:11:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,00:11:59.92,00:12:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:02.12,00:12:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,00:12:04.12,00:12:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s…it’s electrifying!
Dialogue: 0,00:12:07.36,00:12:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay looks like a completely different person out of the timeout.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:11.36,00:12:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Team Lion Heart is staging a furious counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,00:12:14.52,00:12:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay…
Dialogue: 0,00:12:15.96,00:12:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve finally waited for the real you to step onto this court.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:18.36,00:12:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to beat strongest version of you.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:22.32,00:12:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a massive lead, so we should be fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,00:12:24.80,00:12:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:27.28,00:12:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That one percent chance of losing…is happening.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
